stream
BT /F1 14 Tf 56 760 Td (WynDoze-Shield \(WynDoze-InfoScanOverload\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 734 Td (WynDoze-Shield is a local inventory scanner for one operator on this PC. The installed package,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 721 Td (its console scripts, and its RECON_* environment variables keep the WynDoze-InfoScanOverload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 708 Td (name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 688 Td (An agent reads process names, listening ports, service names, installed software names, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 675 Td (local administrator names with their SIDs. It does not read file contents and it does not scan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 662 Td (the network.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 642 Td (A loopback dashboard on 127.0.0.1 scores the report with a YAML rule pack \(windows-default) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 629 Td (v1.5\) and stores findings in SQLite. You review those findings as cards in a browser on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 616 Td (same machine.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 596 Td (Identical evidence on the same host and rule increments the occurrence count and keeps your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 583 Td (decision, including Flagged, Archived, and Suppressed. Changed evidence opens a separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 570 Td (finding in triage. Command lines stay off unless you opt in, and then the agent stores a sealed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 557 Td (token. The dashboard does not decrypt it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 537 Td (The agent does not call a vendor. Upload uses HTTPS, or HTTP only to 127.0.0.1 or ::1. An unset) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 524 Td (ingest token or dashboard password returns 401.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 504 Td (On macOS the agent still collects processes and listening ports. Services, installed software,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 491 Td (and local administrator names stay empty there.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 471 Td (Start-WynDoze.ps1 installs the venv and opens the window. Start dashboard and Stop dashboard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 458 Td (control the loopback server. Run scan collects only and does not upload. Open documentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 445 Td (opens this file when it is in the project folder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 425 Td (Email alerts stay off until you check the box and fill in the SMTP host, port, username,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 412 Td (password, and recipient. The password stays in that process. It is not written into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 399 Td (project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 379 Td (Create scheduled task registers WynDoze-InfoScanOverload-scan for the current user, daily,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 366 Td (weekly, or monthly, at 02:30. That task runs scan --no-upload. It does not upload and it does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 353 Td (not send mail. It is not a SYSTEM task; the SYSTEM installer is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 340 Td (deploy\\windows\\Install-ScanneragentTask.ps1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 320 Td (The Windows operator steps are in user-guide.md. The short start commands for Windows and macOS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 307 Td (are in README.md, and feature.map.md lists every route, variable, and limit.) Tj ET
endstream
